    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "其次是亚合人朵多的儿子以利亚撒。从前非利士人聚集要打仗，以色列人迎着上去，有跟随大卫的三个勇士向非利士人骂阵，其中有以利亚撒。",
      "en": "Next in command[NOTE:1] was Eleazar son of Dodo,[NOTE:2] the son of Ahohi. He was one of the three warriors who were with David when they defied the Philistines who were assembled there for battle. When the men of Israel retreated,[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “after him.”",
        "This follows the Qere and many medieval Hebrew mss in reading דֹּדוֹ (dodo) rather than the Kethib of the MT דֹּדַי (doday; cf. ASV, NIV, NLT). But see 1 Chr 27:4.",
        "Heb “went up.”"
      ],
